| htmfx  | immediate | Adopt .mx Diagnostics & Spec   | Ensure all compiler and runtime error telemetry emits @diag FX-XXXX.| In docs/HYPERFX_AGENTIC_WIKI.md and src/diagnostics/, replace any JSON error schemas with pure .mx format.  |
| htmfx  | high      | Decoupled Peer Host Boundary   | Never duplicate htmxUI components, buttons, or signals.             | Maintain "peerDependencies": { "@hyperlibs/htmxui": ">=1.0.0" }. Mount all 3D via HTMXUI.directive('3d').  |
| htmfx  | normal    | Implement Canonical htmfx.mx   | Use htmfx.mx specification as single source of truth for 3D engine. | Export <hx-viewport>, <hx-mesh>, <hx-particle>, 3denv, 3datmos, and .fx spatial solvers.                     |
| HMLR   | immediate | Initialize HMLR Repository     | Scaffold github.com/hyperlibs/HMLR using canonical hmlr.mx spec.    | Build Chrome/Firefox DevTools extension (Manifest V3) with 4 core panels: Signals, Audit, Spatial, Diag.     |
| HMLR   | high      | Implement Hypermedia Audit     | Replace generic Lighthouse with Hypermedia Velocity metrics.        | Measure HTML swap payload KB, swap latency ms, token cost, and Zero-JS purity grade.                        |
| HMLR   | high      | Real-Time Signal & 3D Tracker  | Ingest HxBolt signal graph and htmFX spatial coordinate viewports.  | Provide time-travel state debugging and live @3d[x, y, z] coordinate entity inspection.                      |
| HMLR   | normal    | Wasm Execution VM Kernel       | Develop <50KB Wasm runtime for Cloudflare Workers (fetch -> Resp).  | Single-pass zero-copy stream parser for .mx documents and .fx functional expressions.                       |

